\":\"/images/cover-art/cover-01.jpg\",\"alt\":\"How to Commission a Custom Album Cover: The Complete 2026 Guide\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Your music is finished. The mix is tight, the mastering is done, and the release date is locked in. Then it hits you: you still need cover art, and a stock template just won't cut it.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Commissioning a \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"custom album cover artist\"}],\" is one of the highest-leverage things an independent artist can do before a release. Cover art is often the first thing a listener sees on a playlist thumbnail or Spotify grid — before they've heard a single note. This guide walks through exactly how the process works, what it costs, and how to hire a digital cover artist online without the usual back-and-forth confusion.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Why Custom Cover Art Matters More Than You Think\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Streaming platforms turned album art into a thumbnail-sized first impression. A generic or AI-generated cover blends into a scroll of a hundred other covers. A custom illustration — one built around your sound, your title, and your visual identity — does the opposite: it stops the scroll.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This isn't unique to music. The same logic applies to \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"manga cover commissions\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"book or webcomic illustration covers\"}],\" — in every case, the cover is doing marketing work before anyone reads or listens to anything.\"]}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\",\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\",\"$L35\",\"$L36\",\"$L37\",\"$L38\",\"$L39\",\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\",\"$L3d\",\"$L3e\",\"$L3f\",\"$L40\",\"$L41\"]}],\"$L42\"]}]}],\"$L43\",\"$L44\"]}]\n45:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n11:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 1: Know What You're Actually Commissioning\"}]\n13:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"Cover art\\\" isn't one thing. Before you reach out to an artist, get clear on which of these you need:\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"li\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Album/single cover art\"}],\" — square format, built for streaming platform thumbnails and vinyl/CD packaging\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Manga or comic cover illustration\"}],\" — character-focused, often with a specific pose, panel composition, or series style to match\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"li\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Book cover illustration\"}],\" — typography-integrated, genre-aware (a thriller cover reads very differently from a fantasy one)\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"li\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Concept/character illustration\"}],\" — for merch, alternate covers, or promotional use\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Knowing this upfront saves you and the artist a round of revisions just to align on scope.\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 2: Gather Your References Before You Reach Out\"}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"29\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Good commissions start with good references, not vague descriptions. Before you contact an artist, put together:\"]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"31\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"2–3 existing covers (any genre) whose \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"mood\"}],\" you like — color palette, composition, energy\"]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Any specific characters, symbols, or objects that must appear\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"33\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Your title/artist name exactly as it should appear, plus any font preferences\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Format requirements: square (3000x3000px is standard for streaming), or a specific print dimension\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"p\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Artists who work in album covers, manga, and illustration — like Jhay Sanyay, who takes commissions across all three — will usually ask for this anyway, so having it ready speeds up your quote and turnaround time significantly.\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n22:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 3: Understand Typical Pricing and Turnaround\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Pricing for custom cover art varies widely based on complexity, but here's a realistic range for independent/freelance illustrators (not agencies):\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"div\",\"table-50\",{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto my-8 border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full text-left border-collapse font-mono text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] font-bold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Type\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Typical Range\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Turnaround\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Simple single/EP cover\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Lower end\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"3–7 days\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Full album cover with characters/scene\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Mid range\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"1–2 weeks\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Manga/comic cover with detailed linework\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Mid-to-high range\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"1–2 weeks\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Rush commission\"}],\"\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"Add a rush fee\"]}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"p-3 border border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":[\"24–72 hours\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"p\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Prices vary by artist and region, so always request a direct quote based on your specific brief rather than assuming a flat rate.\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n27:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 4: What to Look For When You Hire a Digital Cover Artist Online\"}]\n28:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Not every illustrator with a portfolio is set up to handle commissions smoothly. Before booking, check for:\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"li\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"A visible, consistent portfolio\"}],\" — you want to see their range across album covers, manga, or illustration, not just one lucky piece\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"A clear commission process\"}],\" — a booking form or structured request process (rather than \\\"just DM me\\\") is a sign the artist runs this professionally\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Defined revision rounds\"}],\" — know upfront how many revisions are included before extra ones cost more\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Usage rights clarity\"}],\" — confirm you're getting commercial rights to use the art on streaming platforms, merch, or print\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Communication speed\"}],\" — a quick, clear reply to your first inquiry is often a preview of how the whole project will go\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 5: The Commission Process, Start to Finish\"}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Once you've picked an artist, the process typically looks like this:\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"li\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Brief submission\"}],\" — you send your references, title, and requirements (usually through a booking/commission form)\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"li\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Quote and timeline\"}],\" — the artist confirms scope, price, and delivery date\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"li\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Sketch/concept phase\"}],\" — a rough draft or thumbnail sketch for your approval before full rendering\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"li\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Line art and color\"}],\" — the artist builds out the full piece\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"li\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Revisions\"}],\" — you request adjustments within the agreed rounds\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"li\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Final delivery\"}],\" — high-resolution files in the format you need (streaming, print, or both)\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"78\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Artists who specialize across \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"album covers, manga, and illustration\"}],\" — such as \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/ #order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Jhay's Commission Booking Ticket\"}],\" — tend to structure this exact flow, which makes it easier to know what to expect before you commit.\"]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"80\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n39:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"82\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Common Mistakes Artists Make When Commissioning Cover Art\"}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Being too vague in the brief\"}],\" — \\\"something cool and dark\\\" gives the artist nothing to work with\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Skipping the reference stage\"}],\" — references aren't a crutch, they're how you communicate visual language efficiently\"]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"li\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Not budgeting for revisions\"}],\" — rushing approval on the sketch stage often means paying for a bigger revision later\"]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"87\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Ignoring file format needs\"}],\" — confirm you're getting both a high-res print file and a platform-optimized thumbnail version\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n40:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A strong cover does real work for a release — it's often the deciding factor in whether someone clicks play. Whether you're releasing an album, launching a manga series, or publishing a book, taking the commission process seriously — clear references, a real brief, and an artist with a consistent portfolio — is what separates cover art that gets noticed from cover art that gets scrolled past.\"]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"p\",\"95\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If you're looking to commission custom albu