xt-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 4: What to Look For When You Hire a Digital Cover Artist Online\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Not every illustrator with a portfolio is set up to handle commissions smoothly. Before booking, check for:\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"A visible, consistent portfolio\"}],\" — you want to see their range across album covers, manga, or illustration, not just one lucky piece\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"A clear commission process\"}],\" — a booking form or structured request process (rather than \\\"just DM me\\\") is a sign the artist runs this professionally\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"li\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Defined revision rounds\"}],\" — know upfront how many revisions are included before extra ones cost more\"]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"li\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Usage rights clarity\"}],\" — confirm you're getting commercial rights to use the art on streaming platforms, merch, or print\"]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"li\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Communication speed\"}],\" — a quick, clear reply to your first inquiry is often a preview of how the whole project will go\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Step 5: The Commission Process, Start to Finish\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"p\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Once you've picked an artist, the process typically looks like this:\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"li\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Brief submission\"}],\" — you send your references, title, and requirements (usually through a booking/commission form)\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"li\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Quote and timeline\"}],\" — the artist confirms scope, price, and delivery date\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"li\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Sketch/concept phase\"}],\" — a rough draft or thumbnail sketch for your approval before full rendering\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"li\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Line art and color\"}],\" — the artist builds out the full piece\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"li\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Revisions\"}],\" — you request adjustments within the agreed rounds\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"li\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-decimal mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Final delivery\"}],\" — high-resolution files in the format you need (streaming, print, or both)\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"78\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Artists who specialize across \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"album covers, manga, and illustration\"}],\" — such as \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/ #order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Jhay's Commission Booking Ticket\"}],\" — tend to structure this exact flow, which makes it easier to know what to expect before you commit.\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"80\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"82\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Common Mistakes Artists Make When Commissioning Cover Art\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Being too vague in the brief\"}],\" — \\\"something cool and dark\\\" gives the artist nothing to work with\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"li\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Skipping the reference stage\"}],\" — references aren't a crutch, they're how you communicate visual language efficiently\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"li\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Not budgeting for revisions\"}],\" — rushing approval on the sketch stage often means paying for a bigger revision later\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"li\",\"87\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Ignoring file format needs\"}],\" — confirm you're getting both a high-res print file and a platform-optimized thumbnail version\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A strong cover does real work for a release — it's often the deciding factor in whether someone clicks play. Whether you're releasing an album, launching a manga series, or publishing a book, taking the commission process seriously — clear references, a real brief, and an artist with a consistent portfolio — is what separates cover art that gets noticed from cover art that gets scrolled past.\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"95\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If you're looking to commission custom album cover art, manga covers, or illustration work, \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio\"}],\" takes commissions across all three and runs a structured booking process from brief to final delivery.\"]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--re